# Genesis Loop Compatibility

## Current Genesis Loop

```text
Entity registers → starter AI Credits → contribution → AI verify → human approve → CP + AI Credits → ledger
```

## Compatibility Strategy

```text
ContributionEvent  → Proof / Contribution Proof
AI Verification    → VerificationRecord
Human Review       → Reviewer Decision
CreditTransaction  → SettlementParticipant
LedgerRecord       → ProtocolEvent
ReputationScore    → ReputationRecord
```
